{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690490/extras/66e77ac9a4c011d77c468f93e2ad352f.webp?t=1761134206\" width=413 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690490/extras/251c1e01409d5f3e934ca2ce5798ad31.poster.avif?t=1761134206\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690490/extras/251c1e01409d5f3e934ca2ce5798ad31.webm?t=1761134206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690490/extras/251c1e01409d5f3e934ca2ce5798ad31.mp4?t=1761134206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The planet froze over. Now the only things still moving are you, your passengers \u2026 and your train. Roam across diverse terrains, collect more trains and powerful artifacts, and race across endless plains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware. A killing blizzard nips at your heels, while toxic contamination choke the tracks ahead. Study the map, choose smarter routes, and stay one step from catastrophe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690490/extras/a1abd068b074dba8c0ff1b9cbdefb3b3.webp?t=1761134206\" width=442 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690490/extras/166b56eb1b10d8448915b76b3f0bb336.poster.avif?t=1761134206\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690490/extras/166b56eb1b10d8448915b76b3f0bb336.webm?t=1761134206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690490/extras/166b56eb1b10d8448915b76b3f0bb336.mp4?t=1761134206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each supply point lets you deploy drones, bolt on new facilities, and upgrade existing cars. Lucky captains might uncover legendary artifacts or hidden landmarks that reshape an entire run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690490/extras/08c2ce0ce31eef17a8b6372f8292efb4.poster.avif?t=1761134206\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690490/extras/08c2ce0ce31eef17a8b6372f8292efb4.webm?t=1761134206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690490/extras/08c2ce0ce31eef17a8b6372f8292efb4.mp4?t=1761134206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather, upgrade, and expand until you\u2019ve build the perfect synergy of train cars. More happiness means stronger authority\u2014and ever wilder possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690490/extras/36b26c977484a0581e7e9abe77d01815.webp?t=1761134206\" width=338 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690490/extras/f5cf5dce79b41f9050b6d567be427fa4.poster.avif?t=1761134206\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690490/extras/f5cf5dce79b41f9050b6d567be427fa4.webm?t=1761134206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690490/extras/f5cf5dce79b41f9050b6d567be427fa4.mp4?t=1761134206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone on board works at your command\u2014but happiness is fragile. Keep your passengers happy or they\u2019ll vote the conductor off his own engine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690490/extras/969f51e0ea10195660feaf5fdf61f5c3.poster.avif?t=1761134206\" width=974 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690490/extras/969f51e0ea10195660feaf5fdf61f5c3.webm?t=1761134206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690490/extras/969f51e0ea10195660feaf5fdf61f5c3.mp4?t=1761134206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With great power comes greater responsibility. Handle events of small incidents, decide the fate of major epic events, and guide this rolling micro-civilization with a steady hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690490/extras/5adbb618f33f0e25b5cb96a3df2e89e5.webp?t=1761134206\" width=414 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have a mission. Lead your passengers, protect their hope, and see your long-held dream fulfilled. Stay alive, safeguard morale, and prove that even at the end of the world, a single steel leviathan can carry tomorrow on its tracks.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3690490?t=1761134206","background_ra